{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2023-01-19 10:15:00', 'title': 'KROGER CEO DISCUSSES FEEDING THE HUMAN SPIRIT', 'text': "RODNEY MCMULLEN TALKS TAKING CARE OF CUSTOMERS AND ASSOCIATES AT THE NATIONAL RETAIL FEDERATION BIG SHOW 2023 CINCINNATI , JAN. 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA'S GROCER, TODAY SHARED ITS CHAIRMAN AND CEO RODNEY MCMULLEN JOINED MATTHEW SHAY, NATIONAL RETAIL FEDERATION (NRF) PRESIDENT AND CEO, FOR A CONVERSATION ON FEEDING THE HUMAN SPIRIT AT THE NRF BIG SHOW THIS WEEK. MCMULLEN DISCUSSED HOW KROGER OPERATES WITH EXCELLENCE AND CONTINUES TO SERVE CUSTOMERS AND ASSOCIATES IN AN EVER-CHANGING AND COMPETITIVE GROCERY INDUSTRY."}